<title>UK: EIB adds 500 mln Ffr to 10-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 500 mln Ffr to 10-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Societe Generale, has been increased by 500 million French francs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON    *4.5	 MATURITY    10.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN TEC-10 LESS 0.98 PCT</p>
<p>		WITH FLOOR OF 4.50 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 10-100 1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675</p>
<p>NOTES  *LAUNCHED EARLIER FOR 1.0 BILLION FRENCH FRANCS. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
